eas | status | explain`; its terminal question and `install`'s are `askYesNo` in `src/cli/prompt.ts`. The viewer: the Settings → Sharing page, the Sharing section of a project's dock in Across projects, and `GET /api/sharing`, `POST /api/sharing/preview`, `PUT /api/projects/<id>/sharing` (a sharing key in `PUT /api/settings` goes through `applySettingsPatch`). `status` has a `sharing` line, `doctor` a `sharing` check; a restore resets every level to Nothing. No hook reads the policy.
