` in `meta` read by `nameStateOf`; `knowledge_received.remote_alias` keeps its name. `share project <level> [--as <name>] [--create] [--yes]`, `share names`, `share name forget`; the viewer's `POST /api/projects/<id>/sharing/preview`, `DELETE /api/projects/<id>/name`, `GET /api/servers/<id>/names`, every sharing-route refusal in the shape `{ error, reason, …extra }`, the dock's Shared name field (`UInputMenu`). Tests: `tests/helpers/sync-world.ts` (`world(level, { named, server })`), `tests/unit/core-identity.test.ts`, `tests/unit/sharing-names.test.ts`, `tests/integration/team-names.test.ts`, `team-names-push.test.ts`, `sync-contract.test.ts`, `sync-names.test.ts`, `sync-binding.test.ts`, `share-names-cli.test.ts`.
 
